摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Turn DeepSeek Harness into a Codex-style desktop app: native WebView2 shell, system tray, auto-start, Windows toasts, and a Desktop settings tab with a one-of-N skin center.","id":"gh:1333422728","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"Deepseek-Harness-as-Desktop","slug":"KhanZou/Deepseek-Harness-as-Desktop","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Turn DeepSeek Harness into a Codex-style desktop app: native WebView2 shell, system tray, auto-start"},{"id":"p1s2","text":", Windows toasts, and a Desktop settings tab with a one-of-N skin center."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DeepSeek Harness as Desktop"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Turn DeepSeek Harness into a Codex-style desktop app: a native WebView2 shell, system-tray residen"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"cy, auto-start on logon, real Windows toasts, and a set of DSH plugins that add a desktop settings t"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ab, a standalone card-based skin center, reusable right/bottom panels, a Git graph, file/SCM browsin"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"g, a mini terminal, and per-turn token statistics."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文文档"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- 🖥️ **Native WebView2 shell** (`DshDesktop.exe`, C# WinForms + WebView2, x64) — embeds the DSH Web "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"UI in a standalone app window.\n- 🚀 **One-click launch** — the exe detects the backend (`127.0.0.1:30"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"80`); if it is not running, it starts `corepack pnpm dsh web` in the background automatically.\n- 🧭 *"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"*System tray residency** — closing/minimizing hides to tray and keeps running in the background; tra"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"y menu *Open / Exit*. *Exit* stops the backend only if this exe started it.\n- 🔁 **Launch at logon** "},{"id":"p6s6","text":"— optional HKCU `Run` key registration.\n- 🔔 **Real Windows toasts** — task-completion notifications "},{"id":"p6s7","text":"appear in the Action Center (AUMID-registered unpackaged toast), with tray-balloon fallback.\n- ✨ **I"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"nteractive toasts**\n- 🧩 **`dsh-skill-manager` plugin** — per-workspace skill manager (enable/disable"},{"id":"p6s9","text":" project & global skills, copy/apply skill config between projects); ships as an external plugin dep"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"ending on the published `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` workspace packages.\n- 📱 **QQ notifications + remote con"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"versation** — step-by-step setup guide for `dsh-notifier` (outbound push to QQ, inbound remote appro"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"val/dialogue, the pitfalls we actually hit): `docs/qq-notifier-setup.md`.\n— completion notifications"},{"id":"p6s13","text":" show a bounded **answer preview** (title maps the turn-end reason, tools are listed); a **quick-rep"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"ly input + Reply button** sends typed text back to the same session via the official DSH `session.pr"},{"id":"p6s15","text":"ompt` channel; **sandbox permission escalations** show *Allow once / Reject* buttons answered throug"},{"id":"p6s16","text":"h the official DSH `respond` channel. A COM activator (`INotificationActivationCallback`) reads in-t"},{"id":"p6s17","text":"oast text input.\n- ⚙️ **Desktop settings tab** — a **Desktop** section in *Settings* manages close-b"},{"id":"p6s18","text":"utton behavior, auto-start, and notifications. Localized (zh/en), follows the DSH language switcher."},{"id":"p6s19","text":"avior, auto-start, and notifications. Localized (zh/en), follows the DSH language switcher.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Windows 10/11 (x64)\n- Node.js 22.19+ or 24+ and corepack-enabled pnpm\n- Microsoft Edge WebView2 Ru"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ntime (preinstalled on most systems)\n- A DeepSeek Harness checkout"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> **Path assumptions:** the desktop app and plugins are **relocatable** — they\n> derive config, data"},{"id":"p11s2","text":", and script paths from their own location. The only\n> machine-specific path is the DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" checkout, which defaults to\n> `D:\\deepseek harness` and can be changed per-install via the `serverW"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"orkDir`\n> key in `config.json`, or per-launch with `--workdir`."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. **Prepare the harness** (one time):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"2. **Place the app anywhere** — copy the `dsh-desktop-window` folder anywhere\n(e.g. `D:\\dsh-desktop-"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"window`) and double-click\n`dsh-desktop-window\\shell\\DshDesktop.exe` (or build it from `Program.cs` —"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" see\nbelow). It starts the backend if needed and opens the DSH UI in a native window."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"3. **Install the plugins** into the web profile. All six plugins ship in\nthis repository ? each one "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"is a folder under the repo root\n(`dsh-desktop-window/`, `dsh-desktop-settings/`, `dsh-desktop-framew"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ork/`,\n`dsh-skin-gallery/`, `dsh-git-graph/`, `dsh-live-stats/`). Point each\n`add` at its folder (co"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"py the folder anywhere, or use the paths inside\nthis repo):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Restart the desktop app. Then:\n- **Settings → Desktop** — close behavior, auto-start, notifications."},{"id":"p18s2","text":"\n- **Settings → Skin Center** — pick a skin from modern preview cards (mini app-window mockups paint"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ed with the real theme); the UI refreshes.\n- Session header **◧ ◨ ▤** buttons — collapse/expand the "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"right panel and the bottom terminal.\n- Conversation tabs — **Chat / Trajectory / Git Graph**.\n- Afte"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"r each answer, a **live token stats** line appears under the turn."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> The host plugin (`dsh-desktop-window`) is optional but recommended: it sends\n> `turn/end` toasts a"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"nd keeps `skins.json` fresh for the skin center. The\n> desktop app disables its own auto-open via `D"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"SH_DESKTOP_AUTO=0` when it\n> starts the backend itself."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Stored in `D:\\dsh-desktop-window\\config.json`:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Key | Values | Description |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| `closeBehavior` | `tray` (default) / `exit` | Close-button behavior |\n| `autoStart` | `true` / `fa"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"lse` | Launch at logon (HKCU Run) |\n| `notifyOnComplete` | `true` / `false` | Toast on task (turn) c"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ompletion |\n| `activeSkin` | skin id or `\"\"` | Persisted skin-center selection (`\"\"` = DSH default) "},{"id":"p23s4","text":"|\n| `apiPort` | `3980` | Local config API port |\n| `serverWorkDir` | `D:\\deepseek harness` | Harness"},{"id":"p23s5","text":" checkout to start as the backend; overrides the compiled default (`--workdir` arg wins) |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Skin center & skin compatibility"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The **Skin Center** (its own Settings tab, `dsh-skin-gallery`, ordered after\nall native settings tab"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"s) is a one-of-N card picker: the DSH built-in default\nplus every installed skin plugin. Each card p"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"aints a mini app-window mockup\nwith the **actual theme tokens** (no hardcoded colors) — sidebar, cha"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"t bubbles,\ninput bar and a brand-colored send button — using the skin's `accent` color\nwhen the mani"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"fest provides one, and falls back to the current theme otherwise.\nThe current skin is marked with a "},{"id":"p25s6","text":"✓ badge, cards lift on hover, and the grid\nsupports filter chips (All / Built-in / Skins). Picking a"},{"id":"p25s7","text":" skin persists\n`activeSkin` and reloads the UI; on every boot only the selected skin stays\nmounted."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Third-party skins are **not bundled**. To make a skin appear in the picker it\nmust provide a `skin.j"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"son` next to its package and be registered with\n`dsh plugin --profile web add`. See\ndocs/skin-compat"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ibility.md for the full\nconvention."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**Recommended skins**"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- 深海女仆工坊 / Abyssal Maid Atelier by Small-tailqwq — dual-maid backdrop, navy lace UI, chibi sidebar ("},{"id":"p28s2","text":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). Install:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
